      "title_kr": "뉴스와 사회 어휘",
      "body": "Korean news vocabulary bridges formal education and real-world fluency. Major Korean news outlets like KBS, MBC, and JTBC use precise, formal vocabulary. Understanding news language accelerates TOPIK preparation and helps you understand the society you are learning about.",
      "tip": {
        "icon": "📰",
        "label": "Sino-Korean in news",
        "text": "News vocabulary in Korean is heavily Sino-Korean (한자어). Words like 정치 (politics), 경제 (economy), and 사회 (society) all come from Chinese characters. Learning their characters helps you predict meanings across related words."
      },
      "body_ja": "韓国語のニュース語彙は、正式な教育と実践的な流暢さをつなぐ橋です。KBS・MBC・JTBCなどの主要メディアは正確なフォーマル語彙を使います。ニュース言語を理解すればTOPIK対策が加速し、学んでいる社会への理解も深まります。",
      "tip_ja": {
        "label": "ニュースの漢字語",
        "text": "韓国語のニュース語彙は漢字語（한자어）が多く使われます。정치（政治）・경제（経済）・사회（社会）はすべて漢字由来です。漢字を学ぶと関連語の意味が予測できるようになります。"
      }
